12. Word Frequency Analysis Program

feedback = "good service good quality excellent service"
words = feedback.split()
for word in set(words):
    print(word, ":", words.count(word))
Sample Output
good : 2
service : 2
quality : 1
excellent : 1
Note: The order of words may vary because set() does not preserve order.
